---
title: "Tutti i Progetti | Digriisproject - Alessandro Fogliada"
description: "Portfolio completo dei progetti realizzati da Digriisproject: siti web, web application e brand identity per aziende e professionisti."
layout: base.njk
---
<section class="relative w-full py-space-3xl bg-[#070e14] border-t border-slate-800/80" id="portfolio">
<div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-margin md:px-margin-md lg:px-margin-lg">
<div class="flex flex-col md:flex-row md:items-end justify-between mb-space-xl gap-space-md">
<div>
<span class="font-label-uppercase text-label-uppercase tracking-widest text-cyan-400 uppercase mb-space-xs block">Progetti &amp; Case History</span>
<h2 class="font-headline-lg text-headline-lg-mobile md:text-headline-lg text-white tracking-tight">
            Tutti i progetti realizzati
          </h2>
</div>
<!-- Filter Pills Bar -->
<div class="flex items-center gap-1.5 p-1 rounded-lg bg-slate-900 border border-slate-800" id="portfolio-filter-bar">
<button class="portfolio-filter-btn px-space-md py-1.5 rounded-md font-label-uppercase text-label-uppercase tracking-wider transition-all bg-[#486b85] text-white shadow-sm" data-filter="all" type="button">
            Tutti
          </button>
<button class="portfolio-filter-btn px-space-md py-1.5 rounded-md font-label-uppercase text-label-uppercase tracking-wider transition-all text-slate-400 hover:text-white" data-filter="web-design" type="button">
            Siti Web
          </button>
<button class="portfolio-filter-btn px-space-md py-1.5 rounded-md font-label-uppercase text-label-uppercase tracking-wider transition-all text-slate-400 hover:text-white" data-filter="web-solution" type="button">
            Web Solution
          </button>
<button class="portfolio-filter-btn px-space-md py-1.5 rounded-md font-label-uppercase text-label-uppercase tracking-wider transition-all text-slate-400 hover:text-white" data-filter="branding" type="button">
            Brand Identity
          </button>
</div>
</div>
<!-- Project Cards Grid -->
<div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-gutter-lg" id="portfolio-grid">
{% for project in projects %}
<article class="portfolio-item group flex flex-col rounded-xl overflow-hidden bg-slate-900/80 border border-slate-800 hover:border-[#486b85] hover:shadow-[0_0_30px_rgba(72,107,133,0.3)] transition-all duration-300" data-category="{{ project.categories | join(' ') }}">
<div class="relative w-full h-64 overflow-hidden bg-slate-950">
<img class="w-full h-full object-cover transition-transform duration-500 group-hover:scale-105" alt="{{ project.imageAlt }}" src="{{ project.image }}"/>
<div class="absolute top-4 left-4 flex gap-2">
<span class="px-2.5 py-1 rounded bg-slate-950/85 border border-slate-700/60 backdrop-blur-md text-cyan-300 font-label-uppercase text-label-uppercase">{{ project.badge | safe }}</span>
</div>
</div>
<div class="p-space-lg flex flex-col flex-1">
<div class="flex items-center gap-2 mb-space-xs text-cyan-400 font-label-uppercase text-label-uppercase">
<span>{{ project.metaLeft }}</span>
<span>•</span>
<span>{{ project.metaRight }}</span>
</div>
<h3 class="font-headline-sm text-headline-sm text-white font-bold mb-space-xs">
              {{ project.title | safe }}
            </h3>
<p class="font-body-md text-body-md text-slate-400 mb-space-md">
              {{ project.description }}
            </p>
<div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2 mb-space-md">
{% for tag in project.tags %}<span class="px-2 py-0.5 rounded bg-slate-800/80 border border-slate-700/60 font-body-sm text-body-sm text-slate-300">{{ tag | safe }}</span>
{% endfor %}</div>
<div class="mt-auto pt-space-sm border-t border-slate-800/60 flex items-center justify-between">
<span class="font-body-sm text-body-sm text-cyan-400 font-medium">{{ project.location }}</span>
<span class="material-symbols-outlined text-cyan-400 group-hover:translate-x-1 transition-transform">arrow_outward</span>
</div>
</div>
</article>
{% endfor %}

<!-- CTA finale pagina progetti -->
<div class="mt-space-2xl text-center">
<a class="inline-flex items-center gap-space-sm px-6 py-3 rounded-lg bg-[#486b85] text-white hover:bg-[#587e9c] font-label-md text-label-md transition-all duration-300 shadow-md border border-cyan-400/40" href="/#contatti">
<span>Hai un progetto simile in mente? Parliamone</span>
<span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[18px]">chat</span>
</a>
</div>
</div>
</section>


<!-- PROCESSO DI LAVORO (4 STEP TIMELINE) -->
